      "title": "FSN E-Commerce Ventures Confirms Talks to Acquire Stake in 82°E",
      "body": "FSN E-Commerce Ventures Limited (NSEI:NYKAA), which owns beauty and fashion retailer Nykaa, confirmed that it is in talks with Deepika Padukone's skincare brand 82°E (DPKA Universal Consumer Ventures Private Limited) to acquire stake in the latter, in a stock exchange filing late April 6, 2026. \"The company evaluates various strategic opportunities for growth and expansion on an ongoing basis. it remains in discussions with concerned parties, including the one referred above,\" Nykaa said in the filing. \"The company will make appropriate disclosures/announcements in compliance with applicable laws, as and when due,\" it added. ET had reported the development in its April 6 edition.",
